      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALL ABOUT ARLO (1) is a good beginner but will need a quick break. Last start finished 2nd on November 6 over 400m at The Gardens behind Reborn Pulse beaten 2.75 lengths (23.06) in a Maiden. Looks well placed here and rates a key player. Expected to be in the finish. PRIM AND DANDY (2) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (20.10) in a Maiden at Goulburn latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Can improve sharply here. SWAN BAY MISS (5) has an honest record despite remaining a maiden and overdue for a win, having placed five of 12 career runs. Did run very good time (30.91) latest. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Better than last start and can bounce back. JEALOUSY A CURSE (4) is a chance after seven weeks.",
